{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 07 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">图文对齐与生成式 VLM：开放语义不等于视觉事实</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Vision-Language Models</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_104_biomedgpt-title\">BiomedGPT</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">BiomedGPT 以模态无关、任务无关的 encoder—decoder token 化接口统一生物医学视觉、语言和多模态输出。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Modality- and task-agnostic encoder–decoder Transformer unifying biomedical images, clinical text, and bounding boxes into a discrete token sequence interface.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">文本 token、2D 图像 patch/token 及任务指令</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">2D biomedical image patches, text tokens, and task-specifying instruction prompt</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">文本、类别、坐标或图像 token 等统一序列输出</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">Unified autoregressive token stream representing free text, classification labels, or spatial coordinates</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2(a) · PDF p.5</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41591-024-03185-2\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"BiomedGPT original paper architecture figure, Figure 2(a)\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/9163365699c6c1f86cb1.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2(a) · PDF p.5</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_104_biomedgpt\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_104_biomedgpt\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">多模态输入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multimodal input</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">医学图像、自然语言与结构化任务提示</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d biomedical image patches, text tokens, and task-specifying instruction prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (multimodal input).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"医学图像、自然语言与结构化任务提示\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests 2d biomedical image patches, text tokens, and task-specifying instruction prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (multimodal input).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"多模态输入\" data-node-name-en=\"multimodal input\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">多模态输入</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multimodal input</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">医学图像、自然语言与结构化任务提示</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests 2d biomedical image patches, text tokens, and task-specifying instruction prompt and prepares initial tensor representations (multimodal input).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"图像经卷积块稀疏编码为视觉 patch token\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes ResNet patch front-end to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"ResNet patch front-end\" data-node-name-en=\"ResNet patch front-end\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>ResNet patch front-end</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">图像经卷积块稀疏编码为视觉 patch token</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes ResNet patch front-end to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"文本和任务提示编码到共享维度\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs BPE + token embedding within the core unified token encoder decoder generalist computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"BPE + token embedding\" data-node-name-en=\"BPE + token embedding\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>BPE + token embedding</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">文本和任务提示编码到共享维度</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs BPE + token embedding within the core unified token encoder decoder generalist computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"模态、位置和任务标记区分不同 token 语义\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs input sequence within the core unified token encoder decoder generalist computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"统一输入序列\" data-node-name-en=\"input sequence\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">统一输入序列</span><span class=\"lang-en\">input sequence</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">模态、位置和任务标记区分不同 token 语义</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs input sequence within the core unified token encoder decoder generalist computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"跨模态上下文编码并形成共享语义表示\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Transformer encoder within the core unified token encoder decoder generalist computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"Transformer encoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Transformer encoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Transformer encoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">跨模态上下文编码并形成共享语义表示</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Transformer encoder within the core unified token encoder decoder generalist computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"条件于 encoder 表示自回归预测目标 token\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Transformer decoder within the core unified token encoder decoder generalist computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Transformer decoder\" data-node-name-en=\"Transformer decoder\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Transformer decoder</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">条件于 encoder 表示自回归预测目标 token</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Transformer decoder within the core unified token encoder decoder generalist computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"文本、图像、视觉语言与定位任务按 seq2seq 格式混合\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies multi-task pretraining to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"统一多任务预训练\" data-node-name-en=\"multi-task pretraining\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">统一多任务预训练</span><span class=\"lang-en\">multi-task pretraining</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">文本、图像、视觉语言与定位任务按 seq2seq 格式混合</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies multi-task pretraining to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"解码为回答、标签、区域或生成内容\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces unified autoregressive token stream representing free text, classification labels, or spatial coordinates via output.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"任务化输出\" data-node-name-en=\"output\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_104_biomedgpt', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">任务化输出</span><span class=\"lang-en\">output</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">解码为回答、标签、区域或生成内容</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces unified autoregressive token stream representing free text, classification labels, or spatial coordinates via output.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"BiomedGPT Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 跨模态任务统一为提示条件序列生成</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Unified Sequence-to-Sequence Autoregressive Modeling Over Multimodal Biomedical Tokens</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"BiomedGPT：核心公式 · 跨模态任务统一为提示条件序列生成\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"104\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"24.94703pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.742477 -69.00913 225.611329 24.94703\" width=\"225.611329pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.470623-.710065L3.340203-.789766C3.311221-.724556 3.260502-.659346 3.224274-.601381C3.086608-.376769 2.992416-.297068 2.869242-.297068C2.702594-.297068 2.521455-.528926 2.173668-1.231745L1.854863-1.869354C3.021398-2.818523 3.267747-2.963434 3.651762-2.98517L3.644516-3