\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g23-111\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"45.110776\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g23-103\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"52.479768\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g16-63\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"58.550505\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g13-92\" y=\"-55.950221\"></use><use x=\"64.125643\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g4-16\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use><use x=\"68.270084\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g16-72\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"73.653892\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g7-185\" y=\"-62.388495\"></use><use x=\"76.766612\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g13-58\" y=\"-62.388495\"></use><use x=\"81.126603\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g7-186\" y=\"-62.388495\"></use><use x=\"73.128368\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g13-67\" y=\"-54.796877\"></use><use x=\"87.79417\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g10-106\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"93.351039\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g16-72\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"98.734847\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g7-185\" y=\"-62.388495\"></use><use x=\"101.847567\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g13-58\" y=\"-62.388495\"></use><use x=\"106.207558\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g7-186\" y=\"-62.388495\"></use><use x=\"98.325685\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g13-159\" y=\"-54.796877\"></use><use x=\"103.467504\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g13-67\" y=\"-54.796877\"></use><use x=\"109.709287\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g16-150\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"114.248874\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g16-26\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"121.012012\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g13-58\" y=\"-55.950221\"></use><use x=\"126.004619\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g10-185\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"129.72068\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g16-71\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"134.627262\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g10-186\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"138.442938\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g16-150\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"143.430844\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g16-63\" y=\"-57.444602\"></use><use x=\"149.137943\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g13-58\" y=\"-55.950221\"></use><use x=\"153.831674\" xlink:href=\"#m104_g4-17\" y=\"-68.453307\"></use></g></svg>\n</div>\n</section>\n<!-- 5-Column Swiss Specification Matrix -->\n<div class=\"spec-evo-matrix\">\n<div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-bottleneck\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">01 // PRIOR LIMITATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">上一代瓶颈</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">生物医学模型按模态和任务分散，难共享知识与接口</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Biomedical AI models were siloed by modality (radiology vs. pathology vs. text) and task head architecture.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-idea\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">02 // CORE HYPOTHESIS</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">核心想法</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">以统一序列到序列框架处理生物医学图像、文本和多种输出格式</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Map vision patches, text subwords, and spatial locations into a shared discrete vocabulary processed by a unified BART/OFA-style encoder–decoder.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-improvement\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">03 // ARCHITECTURAL DELTA</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">关键改进</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">在多领域多任务数据上联合预训练并用任务提示统一预测</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Multi-task, multi-specialty pretraining + instruction fine-tuning across vision, language, VQA, captioning, and detection.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-adaptation\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">04 // MEDICAL TRANSLATION</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">医学适配</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">覆盖放射、病理、皮肤、文本理解和生成任务</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Generalist biomedical foundation baseline spanning radiology, pathology, ophthalmology, dermatology, and biomedical NLP.</p></div><div class=\"spec-matrix-cell spec-cell-evidence\"><div class=\"cell-kicker\">05 // EVIDENCE &amp; BOUNDARY</div><div class=\"cell-zh-label lang-zh\">适用范围与证据</div><p class=\"cell-val lang-zh\">generalist 医学模型代表；跨中心临床价值仍依赖专门验证</p><p class=\"cell-val cell-val-en lang-en\">Representative generalist architecture; specialist models often retain an edge on high-stakes quantitative or 3D tasks.</p></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 2-Column Design Principles & Medical Translation Band -->\n<div class=\"spec-dual-band\">\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">ARCHITECTURAL AXIOMS // 设计原理与数学机制</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">把不同模态离散成 token，以相同 encoder—decoder 接口处理。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">把分类、生成、问答和定位重写为带任务提示的 seq2seq。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">多领域多任务联合预训练使参数在放射、病理、皮肤和文本任务间共享。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Core Hypothesis: Map vision patches, text subwords, and spatial locations into a shared discrete vocabulary processed by a unified BART/OFA-style encoder–decoder.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Architectural Delta: Multi-task, multi-specialty pretraining + instruction fine-tuning across vision, language, VQA, captioning, and detection.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Mathematical Formalism: Unified Sequence-to-Sequence Autoregressive Modeling Over Multimodal Biomedical Tokens.</li></ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"spec-dual-col\">\n<div class=\"cell-kicker\">CLINICAL TRANSLATION &amp; BOUNDARIES // 医学应用与安全边界</div>\n<ul class=\"spec-bullet-list\"><li class=\"lang-zh\">一个模型可复用到多种生物医学理解和生成任务，降低每任务重新设计 head 的成本。</li><li class=\"lang-zh\">统一 token 不代表统一证据强度；跨模态任务的数据规模、标注质量和安全验证仍须逐项报告。</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Clinical Translation: Generalist biomedical foundation baseline spanning radiology, pathology, ophthalmology, dermatology, and biomedical NLP.</li><li class=\"lang-en bullet-en\">Evidence &amp; Safety Boundary: Representative generalist architecture; specialist models often retain an edge on high-stakes quantitative or 3D tasks.</li></ul>\n</section>\n</div>\n<!-- Provenance Footer Bar -->\n<footer class=\"spec-footer-bar\">\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">PRIMARY LITERATURE // 原始文献</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1038/s41591-024-03185-2\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span>A Generalist Vision-Language Foundation Model for Diverse Biomedical Tasks</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-footer-cell\">\n<span class=\"footer-kicker\">OFFICIAL IMPLEMENTATION // 开源代码</span>\n<a class=\"spec-ext-link\" href=\"https://github.com/taokz/BiomedGPT\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>作者/机构官方实现</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n</div>\n</footer>\n</div>"}